{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12119","headline":"早渡伊川见旧邻作 · 钱起","name":"早渡伊川见旧邻作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鵾鸡鸣早霜，秋水寒旅涉。\n渔人昔邻舍，相见具舟楫。\n出浦兴未尽，向山心更惬。\n村落通白云，茅茨隐红叶。\n东臯满时稼，归客欣复业。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12119.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12119","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}